title: AaldenburgDialogue
tags:
---

<<if DoesHeKnow("AalSetting")>>	
	(Enter DR. AALDENBURG)
<<else>>
	<<Learn AalSetting>>
	SETTING - By a large, copper-plated building, and beneath a giant satellite disk.

	AT RISE - A sharp-faced woman is frantic as she scribbles, walks around as if something is amiss, yet her face conceals any emotion.

	NARRATOR: This woman is someone who would stand out [i]regardless[/i] of how neutral she could be acting. She doesn't notice, or doesn't care, about your approach.
	NARRATOR: She is robotic, following a program of stimuli and response, a set of rules of how everything in the world should be touched, probed, read, and processed.
	NARRATOR: An id-card on her lapel identifies her as "Dr. Aaldenburg - Naturalist Physicist - Nauka Square". 
	
	<< Learn AaldenburgTarot >>
	<< Learn AaldenburgInfoA>>
<<endif>>


<< if DoesHeKnow("SecondLoop") == true >>
	<<jump SecondLoopAaldenburg1>>
<<else>>
	<<jump FirstLoopAaldenburgTree1>>
<<endif>>

//LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1 LOOP 1

===
title: FirstLoopAaldenburgTree1
tags:
---

	-> "Hello?" << if $FirstLoopAaldenburgSaidHello == false >>
		SASHA: "Hello?"
		DR. AALDENBURG: (continues writing)
		-> "Dr. Aaldenburg?"
			SASHA: "Dr. Aaldenburg?"
			DR. AALDENBURG: (continues writing)
			<< set $FirstLoopAaldenburgSaidHello = true >>
			<< jump FirstLoopAaldenburgTree1 >>
	-> "Do you know where Dmitriy Yildiz is?" << if $FirstLoopAaldenburgSaidDmitriy == false >>
		SASHA: "Do you know where Dmitriy Yildiz is?" 
		DR. AALDENBURG: (continues writing, glances up at lake)
		-> "Big guy, black hair, was setting things up around here?"
			SASHA: "Big guy, black hair, was setting things up around here?"
			DR. AALDENBURG: (stares at lake for a few moments, then continues writing)
			<< set $FirstLoopAaldenburgSaidDmitriy = true >>
			<< jump FirstLoopAaldenburgTree1 >>
	-> "What are you writing in that notebook?" << if $FirstLoopAaldenburgSaidHello == true && $FirstLoopAaldenburgSaidDmitriy == true >>
		SASHA: "What are you writing in that notebook?"
		DR. AALDENBURG: (pauses writing)
		DR. AALDENBURG: "Leave me alone. I am occupied."
		DR. AALDENBURG: (continues writing)
	-> "I’ve done a technical study too. Just graduated." << if $TechMajor == true && $FirstLoopAaldenburgSaidHello == true && $FirstLoopAaldenburgSaidDmitriy == true >>
		SASHA: "I’ve done a technical study too. Just graduated." 
		DR. AALDENBURG: (stops writing for a moment, then quickly continues as if pretending not to hear you)
		DR. AALDENBURG: (exasparated.) Then we can talk later.
		DR. AALDENBURG: I am engaged in field work at this moment. I cannot chit-chat.
	
	<<stop>>






//LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 LOOP 2 
