        DR. AALDENBURG: .. [i]No[/i], you cannot swim to the island. You will most likely die.
	    DR. AALDENBURG: As for other options, I am not aware of any.
-> "Do you have any idea of how I can get to the island? Can I swim there, or do I need a boat?"
